/Title (Off-site concrete: a reliable alternative)
/Subject (rics, isurv, contract administration, procurement, tendering,  design and build )
/Author (Jill Haldon)
/Keywords (Are design and build contracts inherently flawed or just badly managed, asks Andrew McSmythurs? Set up and managed properly, design and build \(D&amp;B\) contracts can provide excellent value for money, with enhanced, early out-turn certainty across a range of often complex projects and for diverse client groups.)
